(* Rung 3 Task 5: Cbor encode golden. A Map with Symbol keys #n -> 42, #s -> 'hi'.
   Symbols encode as CBOR tag 39 (identifier) wrapping major-3 text; the Map is
   major 5 with keys in RFC 8949 bytewise order over the ENCODED key bytes, and
   Integer/String payloads via the C int leaf / major-3 text.
   Golden authored independently from python cbor2 6.1.3 (see 14_cbor/README.md):
   dumps({CBORTag(39,'n'):42, CBORTag(39,'s'):'hi'}, canonical=True) — verified
   equal to an explicit RFC 8949 bytewise sort. *)
class CborGoldenHexTest packageUsing: manifest = () (
public main: platform args: args = (
  | M m |
  M:: platform Map.
  m:: M with: #n -> 42 with: #s -> 'hi'.
  (platform Cbor encode: m) printHex println.
)
